      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In early 2000, the McLeod family decided to develop Spring Valley Ranch into a community that would sustain future generations.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.avimor.com/avimor-story",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2002, Avimor partnered with SunCor and Avimor Partners to put the master‑plan into action.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.avimor.com/avimor-story",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "About 100 miles of Avimor trails already connect the community and the public.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
